[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2584897743","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101411#issuecomment-2584897743","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101411","id":2584897743,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6aEmjP","user":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-10T23:45:14Z","updated_at":"2025-01-10T23:50:40Z","body":"Not a good idea to render them all at such a high edge detail. They are frequently used in large quantity already causing editor performance issues on weaker hardware. We could only render the single selected gizmo at higher quality while keeping everything else at low detail.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2584897743/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2584941111","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101411#issuecomment-2584941111","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101411","id":2584941111,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6aExI3","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-11T00:10:49Z","updated_at":"2025-01-11T00:11:40Z","body":"> Not a good idea to render them all at such a high edge detail. They are frequently used in large quantity already causing editor performance issues on weaker hardware. We could only render the single selected gizmo at higher quality while keeping everything else at low detail.\r\n\r\nHow many NavigationLinks do we expect to have in large scenes?\r\n\r\nIdeally, we'd use some form of LOD but this will require keeping a second copy of the gizmo (to swap between high and low detail). We don't need new *nodes* for this (gizmos use RenderingServer APIs directly and we can use `instance_geometry_set_visibility_range()`), but it will make the code quite a bit more complex.\r\n\r\nSwapping gizmos depending on whether it's selected could also be done, but your camera may get up close to gizmos even if they're unselected. It would also require complexifying the code somewhat, though not as much as using LOD.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2584941111/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2584946317","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101411#issuecomment-2584946317","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101411","id":2584946317,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6aEyaN","user":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-11T00:17:59Z","updated_at":"2025-01-11T00:20:36Z","body":"> How many NavigationLinks do we expect to have in large scenes?\r\n\r\nDepends on the project but some projects frequently stack them en masse every 0.25 - 0.5 m around geometry that actors can drop off or jump up so larger projects end up with something like this for just a single geometry piece or section.\r\n\r\n![linkspam](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8cc74288-5698-4044-9513-bc49518587e7)\r\n\r\nThat link spam can be seen commonly even in AAA productions because level designers hear no bell.\r\n\r\n![morelinkspam](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5baedc56-fa6d-4523-a832-c3c0cbcee481)\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2584946317/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2585126019","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101411#issuecomment-2585126019","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101411","id":2585126019,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6aFeSD","user":{"login":"kiroxas","id":3176062,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxNzYwNjI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3176062?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas","html_url":"https://github.com/kiroxas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-11T07:03:42Z","updated_at":"2025-01-11T07:03:42Z","body":"> Not a good idea to render them all at such a high edge detail. They are frequently used in large quantity already causing editor performance issues on weaker hardware. We could only render the single selected gizmo at higher quality while keeping everything else at low detail.\r\n\r\nThe performance issue is in the gizmo creation (too many cos/sin) or on the rendering side (too many points) ? Or a little bit of both ?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2585126019/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2585208212","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101411#issuecomment-2585208212","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101411","id":2585208212,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6aFyWU","user":{"login":"JekSun97","id":130399274,"node_id":"U_kgDOB8W8Kg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/130399274?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97","html_url":"https://github.com/JekSun97","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-11T11:20:54Z","updated_at":"2025-01-11T11:20:54Z","body":"I agree with smix8, more segments may improve the visual appearance, but in large quantities we will lose performance, it is unlikely that it is worth developing LOD for this little-noticed aspect.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2585208212/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2588852091","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101411#issuecomment-2588852091","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101411","id":2588852091,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6aTr97","user":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-14T03:37:53Z","updated_at":"2025-01-14T03:38:41Z","body":"With the performance improving linked PR merged I dont see the performance part that critical anymore but still, I think increasing from 30 to 360 is a little excessive. Might want to settle for some middle ground between visual-40k-fidelity and good-enough-for-debug.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2588852091/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2614026251","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101411#issuecomment-2614026251","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101411","id":2614026251,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bzuAL","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-25T16:44:54Z","updated_at":"2025-01-25T16:44:54Z","body":"> With the performance improving linked PR merged I dont see the performance part that critical anymore but still, I think increasing from 30 to 360 is a little excessive. Might want to settle for some middle ground between visual-40k-fidelity and good-enough-for-debug.\r\n\r\nDone (see OP for updated screenshots).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2614026251/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"p